A608F"}, "display_name": "OrbBlitzVR", "keywords": ["casual", "arcade", "wavesurvival", "OrbBlitzVR", "iamsince1998"], "long_description": "---\n\n## \ud83c\udfaf One More Round\n\nJoin the Discord Community to - get promo codes for better discounts.\n\nNo tutorials. No cutscenes. No filler. Just **pure, distilled VR reflex bliss** \u2014 pick up and play in seconds, impossible to master in a lifetime.\n\nChase your personal best. Climb the leaderboard.\n\n*One more round \u2014 you always say that, don't you?*\n\n---\n\n**At the price of a cup of tea** \u2014 Orb Blitz VR delivers an arcade rush that'll have your arms swinging and your heart pounding, every single time.\n\n> \ud83e\udd7d **Meta Quest 2 / Quest 3 / Quest 3S**\n> \ud83c\udfae Standing or Room-Scale \u00b7 Single Player \u00b7 All Ages\n{27033014449719141}\n\nHotfix 1.02", "short_description": "Fling. Deflect. Dominate. Pure VR reflex mayhem \u2014 one platform, endless orb waves, one score that never stops calling you back."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/iamsince1998/home/orbblitzvr-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Deepak", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/CVB4U2fBkJ", "website_url": "https://discord.gg/CVB4U2fBkJ", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "suppo